{"id":"fc75264a5ecdc3fb","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-uniform-ce-sequence.md","title":"统一可枚举集合列","display":"df-uniform-ce-sequence — 统一可枚举集合列","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence","aliases":["20-df-uniform-ce-sequence"],"display":"df-uniform-ce-sequence — 统一可枚举集合列","chapter":"2","section":"2.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 2.6.1(i)","source_printed_pages":[46],"source_pdf_pages":[82],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-uniform-ce-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-uniform-ce-sequence — 统一可枚举集合列"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 2.6.1(i)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>46</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>82</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=(V_e)_{e\\in\\omega}\">\\(V=(V_e)_{e\\in\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_e\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(V_e\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span> 为上游的全函数限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}ce\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{UniformCE}(V)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall e\\ [V_e=W_{f(e)}].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}ce\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{UniformCE}(V)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall e\\ [V_e=W_{f(e)}].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每列分别 c.e. 不等于存在同一个全可计算索引函数。此谓词把有效性条件放在列序列整体上。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 2.6.1(i)；印刷页 46；PDF 第 82 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V=(V_e)_{e\\in\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"V_e\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}uniform\\text{-}ce\\text{-}sequence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{UniformCE}(V)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall e\\ [V_e=W_{f(e)}].","display":true}],"bytes":1219,"backlinks":[{"id":"a7fc9a5f08d87b69","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"404345cb6603a5c9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-independence]]；see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-df-degle]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"bb045b68eb24d902","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-independence]]；see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-lem-one-action-priority-bound]]；see [[20-lem-use-preservation]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-oracle-stage-evaluation]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。"},{"id":"ceab247000d7caa9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"eb7be9972d7be6ba","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"